<title>USA: Seidman raises stake in Wayne Bancorp.</title>
<headline>Seidman raises stake in Wayne Bancorp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by investor Lawrence Seidman said Wednesday it raised its stake in Wayne Bancorp Inc to 145,150 common shares or 6.50 percent of the outstanding from 5.34 percent held on August 5.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 28,500 additional common shares between August 2 and August 23 at prices ranging from $11.937 to $12.875 per share.</p>
<p>The shares were bought for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
</text>
